HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_547cf577, "two Heroes types over one C type is a hole nothing can close: this compiler refuses handing one where the other belongs, and clang accepts it, so the mistake survives every check the language has. Give the two types two tags, or give the one type one name and use it twice");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1795a2a8, "it is a handle, an address C owns");
